msgctxt "148"
msgid "Hey. She and I have somewhere to be tonight, and you're not invited."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Help!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Who the fuck? You got a death wish, asswipe?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Hey, now... Let's not get ahead of ourselves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "You know Shiori? I don't think you had her requested..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Well, it's not like you're the only guy she met there. I've had her plenty "
"of times myself..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Anyway, she's out of the club, so it doesn't matter. This is between me and "
"her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Damn right I'm out! You kept blowing up over nothing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Heheheh... Well, after all that cash I spent on you, I figure I deserve a "
"little return on investment, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "That's sick, man! Who'd want to touch a creep like you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "You're pathetic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Oh, <Italic>I'm</Italic> pathetic? Maybe you don't know who you're talking "
"to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "See, I'm this club's biggest paying customer. Without me? They'd be nothing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"Buddy, I don't know how many times you've gone to that club, but let me "
"clue you in... You're out of your league."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"And if you're gonna get in my way, well, you're gonna find it real hard to "
"enjoy the nightlife from a hospital bed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Cockblocked when it was just gettin' good... I'm gonna beat yer ass into "
"the ground!"
msgstr ""

